# This repo is PUBLIC. Private key material must never land here.
#
# Not hypothetical: the build tree's scripts/ and plans/ are symlinks INTO this
# repo, so anything resolving paths through those symlinks (e.g. Python's
# Path(__file__).resolve()) escapes the tree and writes here instead. On
# 2026-07-16 that dropped a private boot-signing key into this working copy. It
# was caught before staging only because someone looked -- there was no
# .gitignore to stop it. Hence this file.
#
# Signing keys belong in the build tree at vendor/lineage-priv/, which is never
# pushed anywhere.
*.pk8
*.pem
*.key
*.jks
*.keystore
vendor/

# Editor/OS noise
*.swp
.DS_Store
.release-notes.md
